flowchart LR
  subgraph Dyna[External owner: Dyna Robotics]
    Assets[Published Taku visual meshes and joint tree]
    Log[Public teleoperation log<br/>869 samples at 12 Hz]
    Reference[Laundry-room poster and partial dryer metadata]
    Missing[Original dynamics, controller and cloth assets<br/>not located in inspected public release]
  end
  subgraph Scene[Owner: scene agent<br/>Isolated taku-public-replay package]
    FK[Decode channels and compute link poses]
    Room[Estimated basket, towels, table,<br/>washer, dryer and shelves]
    Render[MuJoCo visual replay on CPU<br/>No physics stepping or policy inference]
    Video[Complete recordings and frame logs]
  end
  subgraph Review[Owner: coordinator and independent reviewer]
    Check[Source, pose, frame, process and visual checks]
    Publish[Read-only local viewer on port 8771<br/>Byte-range video playback; scene first]
  end
  Assets -->|data| FK
  Log -->|data| FK
  Reference -->|data: source values and visual estimates| Room
  FK -->|data: unchanged robot poses| Render
  Room -->|data: props and scripted door| Render
  Check -.->|control: bounded CPU admission| Render
  Render -->|data| Video
  Video -->|data: verify before publication| Check
  Check -->|control: publish checked media| Publish
  Missing -.->|blocks exact autonomous reproduction| Check
